    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo! Akukunkumuka kuEjipitu nawu ayikwashuku, akwatila Ŋovu kutuwalu; akuhwelelaŋa makálu nanochu chaswejawu kuvula, akuhwelelaŋa akwatuwalu nanochu chaswejawu Ŋovu; kutala kudi Wajila waIsarela nehi, kukeŋakeŋa kudi Yehova nehi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoŋa niyena nawa wukweti maana, wakaleta katama, hakabalumuna nawa cheŋi mazu induku; wakanyamukila mutaŋa wawakwakwila chatama, wakanyamukila wukwashi wawakwakukoŋa yakuluwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AEjipitu hiyantu hohu, hiNzambuku; tuwalu twawu hinyijimba hohu, hispirituku. Yehova chakololayi chikasachindi niwakakwasha akwawu wakahukana, niwakakwashewa wakadimbuka, akanoŋela kumu wejima wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova naŋili nindi, Chabulumaŋa mutupa, nimwenzi wamutupa hakanyama kindi kanakwatiyi, hela akumutambikila tubiŋa twatuvulu, yena hakubaŋa izu dawuku, hakudizoza nepumba dawuku, dichi chakasulukayi Yehova wamazaza nakulwa hampidiya Ziyona, nihamulundu wayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaselaŋawu atujila dichi chakakiŋayi Yehova wamazaza Yerusalema, wakawukiŋa, wakawupulwisha; wakahitahewulu nakuwuhemba chachiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyana kaIsarela, balumukenu mutali kudi imunadikaŋa nindi nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa denodu ifuku nkishi jenu jasiliva, ninkishi jenu jawuru, ŋamu neli namakasenwenu aweni kulondanshidi, mwakajinata wejima wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu aAshuri akadimboka nampoku yakabali, hiyamuntuku; mpoku yakabali, hiyawantuku, yakayidya; akatemuka mpoku yakabali, anyikwenzi jawu akasuma kumpoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilola dindi dakafuma namutentu wakatiyawu, tulamba twindi akakomoka mpandelu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wukweti kesi kindi muZiyona, wukweti luteŋi lwindi muYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
